                "Bowl-B9 at Granule-Nave GN-3 is already spraying binder at 18.0 kg/h while exhaust IR "
                "sits at 198 C against a 125 C bed-product cap. An exhaust-first latch clamps "
                "the spray; a spray-first story would keep the 18.0 kg/h cruise. Stored "
                "hoop in the granule shell is not yet an observable of either race channel.",